          "resourceKind": "html",
          "contentBody": "Basic Page\nWhat is Experimental Psychology?\nbranches:   the various areas of study in psychology scientific method:  a systematic way of gathering data, determining relationships, and offering conclusions\n link opens in a new window/tab)",
