          "contentBody": "Conclusion Page\nSection 1 Conclusion\nYou have reached the end of the content for Section 1 of Module 1.\nResearchers in education and learning have determined that people retain more information when they take regular breaks and move their bodies. Using this information, please take your dog for a walk.  If you don't have a dog, see if you can borrow one -- a friendly one preferably.\nNext Steps\nWhen you return from your walk, please continue with Module 1 Section 2.",
