          "contentBody": "Conclusion Page\nSection 2 Conclusion\nDo you remember what you read at the end of Section One about taking regular breaks and moving your body?\nGo get a drink of water... or maybe some decaffeinated green tea.  You choose.\nSource: https://www.aquazania.co.za/2016/09/can-             source: https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/top-\n         my-glass-of-water-go-off-18092016/                              0-evidence-based-health-benefits-of-green-tea\nNext Steps\nWhen you're done with your break, please complete Assignment One and upload it to Brightspace so your teacher can provide feedback.  While waiting for feedback you can continue with Module 1 Section 3.",
