          "resourceKind": "html",
          "contentBody": "Conclusion Page\nSection 3 Conclusion\nAre you ready for your break?  Have you been working longer than 30 minutes? If you answer \"yes\" to either of these questions, please take a break.  Some people like to hug trees.  If you don't know how to hug a tree, please visit this link: How to Hug a Tree\nIf you choose not to hug a tree, maybe you can find a cat, your little brother or sister, maybe a grandparent.... you decide.  You can even hug yourself!\nNext Steps\nWhen you're done, please continue with Section 4 of Module 1.",
