          "sourceHref": "сontent/i888f75da-9179-4f03-8123-fefe750f87e6/Pellagra (A Corny Story!).html",
          "resourceKind": "html",
          "contentBody": "Pellagra (A Corny Story!)\nThis case study is summarized from That's the Way the Cookie Crumbles:  62 All-New Commentaries on the Fascinating Chemistry of Everyday Life by Joe Schwarcz.\nGetting You ThinkingQ.  Do you think enticing prisoners with freedom is an ethical way to enlist volunteers in research?",
