          "resourceKind": "html",
          "contentBody": "Pavlov's Conditioned Response ExperimentsThis experiment was instrumental in the creation and formation of behavioural psychology as a valid science.  Lessons learned from this experiment have been used in many fields including marketing, parenting, and education.\nWhen you have finished reading the case study, you may wish to try a game version of the experiment.  Be patient, it might take a few attempts to train the dog to drool!\nGame Version: Pavlov's Dog Experiments",
