          "sourceHref": "сontent/i6e97955b-58c1-4db9-a484-7adf086a8ea3/Learned Helplessness.html",
          "resourceKind": "html",
          "contentBody": "Learned HelplessnessI give up!!For many years researchers were perplexed as to why some people, when in obviously negative situations, did not try to avoid the situations when they could.  For example, why did some people stay in abusive relationships?  Why did some people give up trying to learn new skills?   This case study provides insight into possible reasons for these behaviours.\nGetting You ThinkingQ:  Do you think deliberately inflicting pain on animals so that we may learn about behaviour is acceptable?",
